{"product_id":"soulbinder","title":"Soulbinder","description":"\u003cp\u003eKellen and his murderous squirrel cat, Reichis, are on their own. They've heard rumour of a mythical monastery, known as the Ebony Abbey. It's a place that outsiders can never find - but Kellen is getting desperate. He's been told that the monks inside the Ebony Abbey know more about the Shadowblack than anyone else - and that they even know how to cure it. Then Kellen and Reichis are separated and for the first time, Kellen must face the world alone - and venture deeper into shadow magic than he ever knew he could.\u003cbr\u003e\nDimensions: 129 x 198\u003cbr\u003e\nAuthor: Sebastien de Castell\u003cbr\u003e\nISBN: 9781471406744\u003cbr\u003e\nFormat: Paperback\u003cbr\u003e\nPages: 422\u003c\/p\u003e","brand":"bookloopbook.com","offers":[{"title":"Default Title","offer_id":45834338238617,"sku":"17RD-39781471406744","price":10.0,"currency_code":"AED","in_stock":true}],"thumbnail_url":"\/\/cdn.shopify.com\/s\/files\/1\/0580\/5696\/6297\/files\/68ff76480a418_Soulbinder_Sebastien_de_Castell.jpg?v=1761588338","url":"https:\/\/bookloopbook.com\/products\/soulbinder","provider":"Dubai - Buy Used\/Second-Hand Books - Book Loop Book","version":"1.0","type":"link"}